---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const title = 'Terms of Use — Chicking Mohali';
const description = 'Terms governing the use of the Chicking Mohali website and the franchise / waitlist enquiry forms.';
const updated = '17 June 2026';
---

<Layout title={title} description={description}>
  <section class="section legal">
    <p class="section-label">Legal</p>
    <h1 class="section-title">Terms of Use</h1>
    <p class="updated">Last updated: {updated}</p>

    <p>These Terms govern your use of this website, operated by <strong>Trinity Foods International LLP</strong>
    for the Chicking Mohali franchise (“we”, “us”, “our”). By using the site or submitting a form, you agree to these Terms.</p>

    <h2>1. Nature of this site</h2>
    <p>This website provides information about the Chicking Mohali outlet and lets you register interest as a
    customer (waitlist / Founders Club) or as a prospective franchise partner. Information is provided in good
    faith for general guidance.</p>

    <h2>2. Not an offer or solicitation</h2>
    <p>Nothing on this site constitutes a franchise offer, prospectus, securities offer, or investment
    solicitation. <strong>No financial returns, profits, payback periods, or business outcomes are guaranteed
    or implied.</strong> Any franchise relationship is governed solely by a separate written agreement signed
    by both parties.</p>

    <h2>3. Brand and global figures</h2>
    <p>References to Chicking’s global presence (475+ outlets, 45+ countries, founded Dubai 2000) describe the
    worldwide brand. The Mohali outlet is the first Chicking in North India and is operated under franchise by
    Trinity Foods International LLP.</p>

    <h2>4. Enquiry forms</h2>
    <p>You agree to provide accurate information and not to submit forms in an automated, abusive, or fraudulent
    manner. We may rate-limit, decline, or remove submissions to protect the service.</p>

    <h2>5. Intellectual property</h2>
    <p>The “Chicking” name and logo are trademarks of their respective owner and are used under franchise. Site
    content may not be copied or reused without permission.</p>

    <h2>6. Privacy</h2>
    <p>Your personal data is handled as described in our <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>

    <h2>7. Limitation of liability</h2>
    <p>To the extent permitted by law, we are not liable for any loss arising from reliance on information on this
    site. The site is provided “as is” without warranties of any kind.</p>

    <h2>8. Governing law</h2>
    <p>These Terms are governed by the laws of India, and disputes are subject to the jurisdiction of the courts
    at Mohali / Chandigarh, Punjab.</p>

    <h2>9. Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions about these Terms: <a href="mailto:franchise@rudradigital.uk">franchise@rudradigital.uk</a>.</p>
  </section>

  <style>
    .legal { max-width: 760px; }
    .legal .updated { color: var(--grey); font-size: 0.9rem; margin-top: -0.75rem; margin-bottom: 2rem; }
    .legal h2 { font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 800; margin: 2rem 0 0.5rem; letter-spacing: -0.01em; }
    .legal p, .legal li { color: #374151; }
    .legal a { color: var(--chicking-red); text-decoration: underline; }
  </style>
</Layout>
